for community members in the neighborhood to where,

00:08:50.947 --> 00:08:51.187
you know,

00:08:51.227 --> 00:08:51.568
you're really,

00:08:51.629 --> 00:08:51.828
like,

00:08:51.948 --> 00:08:53.110
balancing the city again.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:53.350
Well,

