It was great to talk with Brent.

00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:02.447
He seems like he's doing a lot for the community.

00:09:03.028 --> 00:09:04.129
They're cleaning up this lot,

00:09:04.249 --> 00:09:05.870
and eventually it's going to be an urban farm.

00:09:06.432 --> 00:09:10.997
And then all the fruit and vegetables is going to be sold across the street in this old market.

00:09:11.557 --> 00:09:13.298
And right now we're currently in a food desert.

00:09:13.619 --> 00:09:16.022
So that means there's nowhere to get fresh food around here.

00:09:16.162 --> 00:09:18.725
